"Mute Sirens": "禁用汽笛警报",
"My dick is malleable, it can be shaped into any form i desire, and with the magic of stop motion technology, i have crudely recreated every wallace and grommit movie using nothing but my plasticine dick. Recently, my dick has dried up, and is now permanently shaped like the steamroller from bob the builder. Well, Prince, so Genoa and Lucca are now just family estates of the Buonapartes. But I warn you, if you don't tell me that this means war, if you still try to defend the infamies and horrors of that antichrist - I really believe he is antichrist - I will have nothing more to do with you. When it's colder at night than outside, should you walk rather than go uphill because it's not so dark then? Although uphill is actually closer than walking. And above all, it's warmer than going downhill. But for pregnant virgins it's always further than during the day. Only for the three merry two it will always be colder than by train, because the train goes faster than standing. But the train still takes longer than the plane because the plane flies further in water than in milk. No wonder, the plane is lighter in the morning than the train. But you can also swim on foot by car. It's even cheaper than in the city. But the best thing of all - you just stay at home. It's always nicer there than at home! But where does the banana get its bones?": "我的鸡巴是可塑的，它可以塑造成我想要的任何形状，并且凭借定格动画技术的魔力，我只用我的橡皮泥鸡巴粗略地再现了每一部华莱士和格罗米特电影。最近，我的鸡巴干了，现在永久地变成了建筑工人鲍勃的压路机的形状。好吧，王子，所以热那亚和卢卡现在只是波拿巴家族的家族庄园。但我警告你，如果你不告诉我这意味着战争，如果你仍然试图为那个反基督者的恶名和恐怖辩护——我真的相信他是反基督者——我将不再与你有任何关系。当晚上比外面冷时，你应该步行而不是上山，因为那时天还没有那么黑吗？虽然上山实际上比步行更近。最重要的是，它比下坡温暖。但对于怀孕的处女来说，这总是比白天更远。只是对于三个快乐的两个人来说，它总是比乘火车更冷，因为火车比站立更快。但火车仍然比飞机需要更长的时间，因为飞机在水中比在牛奶中飞得更远。难怪，早上飞机比火车轻。但您也可以开车步行游泳。甚至比城里还便宜。但最棒的是——你只需呆在家里。那里总是比家里好！但香蕉的骨头是从哪里来的呢？",
